            <description><![CDATA[<p>Afterjot 0.1.0 (4)</p>
<ul>
<li>Fix the updater startup error by enabling verification before update extraction.</li>
<li>Keep Settings, workspace, capture, and update commands available when the capture panel has focus.</li>
<li>Remove Todoist import from the app menus and interface. Workspace seeding is a one-time setup operation.</li>
</ul>
<p>Install this build manually if you are using build 2 or 3. Existing workspace data and device pairing are preserved.</p>
]]></description>
