            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Afterjot 0.1.0 (3)</p>
<ul>
<li>Open Afterjot from the Dock, use the app menus, and right-click or Control-click its menu-bar icon for workspace, capture, import, settings, and updates.</li>
<li>Preview and import a Todoist JSON snapshot. Projects, sections, tasks, work dates, and deadlines map into Afterjot. Unsupported fields remain visible as reference data. Repeat imports preserve your Afterjot edits.</li>
<li>Check for signed updates with Sparkle. Automatic checks are optional and can be changed in Settings.</li>
</ul>
<p>Mac–iPhone sync requires a configured private relay and device pairing. This update does not initialize a server or import data automatically.</p>
]]></description>
